 devicetree@vger.kernel.org, Philipp Zabel <p.zabel@pengutronix.de>,
 yi.kuo@mediatek.com, linux-mediatek@lists.infradead.org,
 Hsin-Yi Wang <hsinyi@chromium.org>, ming-fan.chen@mediatek.com,
